{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014JmPLksZBm6LsWi88TgtK5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '整体叙事从 \"new SOTA via safety-aware routing\" 转向 \"first explicit\n2\t  study of when deterministic computation helps LLM agents, with controlled causal\n3\t  evidence\"。 C1 不与 CogRouter 直接比 SOTA，改为强调 SimGate vs 自身 ablation baselines 的受控实验，headline\n4\t  为 \"reduces catastrophic failures by ~50%\"。 C2 explicit vs implicit 差距写成 \"consistent\n5\t  but moderate advantage\"，重心转向 interpretability/modularity 的定性价值。 routing pattern\n6\t  分析从 failure mode taxonomy 降为 phase-dependent routing trends。 补充 plan-006 (2-way\n7\t  vs 3-way) 增加实验密度弥补 headline number 不够突出的不足。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Mini Signal Detection (Pre-screening)\n12\t  plan_id: plan-001a\n13\t  description: '对 ~20 个 ScienceWorld task type 各跑 5 episodes，2-way (internal + deterministic)，\n14\t    筛选出 det > internal 的 task types 进入 plan-001b。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    total_task_types_screened: 20\n19\t    signal_positive_task_types: 13\n20\t    strong_signal_types: 7\n21\t    moderate_signal_types: 4\n22\t    weak_signal_types: 2\n23\t    no_signal_types: 7\n24\t    strong_signal_list: boil, melt, change-state-of-matter, freeze, use-thermometer,\n25\t      mix-chemicals, react-acid-base\n26\t    moderate_signal_list: mix-paint, measure-melting-point, conduct-electricity, identify-life-stages\n27\t    weak_signal_list: grow-plant-basic, navigate-rooms\n28\t    no_signal_example: grow-plant-advanced, read-thermometer, find-animal, classify-living,\n29\t      ecology-food-web, identify-rocks, use-microscope\n30\t    mean_det_minus_internal_strong: 38.5\n31\t    mean_det_minus_internal_moderate: 18.2\n32\t    mean_det_minus_internal_weak: 6.3\n33\t    gpu_hours_actual: 9.5\n34\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 death avoidance 是主要增益来源但集中在 physics/chemistry tasks。\n35\t    涉及温度变化、相态转换、化学反应的 7 个 task type 展示强信号（det-internal ~35-45 分）， 因为 LLM 在多步物理推理中频繁\n36\t    hallucinate 状态导致 death (-100)，deterministic oracle 消除了这些 catastrophic failures。\n37\t    4 个 moderate signal tasks 有部分物理/化学子步骤但非全程依赖，增益在 10-25 分。 2 个 weak signal tasks\n38\t    动作空间简单、death 风险低，deterministic 的 safety-net 价值有限。 7 个 no-signal tasks（生态观察、分类、阅读类）几乎无\n39\t    death 惩罚，internal reasoning 本身足够， det invocation 反而引入不必要的 rigid execution，无法利用\n40\t    LLM 的灵活推理优势。 这个 13/20 的通过率说明 safety-aware routing 不是 universal solution，而是 domain-specific\n41\t    mechanism。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - name: 'Table: Signal Pre-screening Results (5 episodes per task type)'\n46\t    columns:\n47\t    - task_type\n48\t    - domain\n49\t    - internal_mean\n50\t    - det_mean\n51\t    - det_minus_internal\n52\t    - death_rate_internal\n53\t    - death_rate_det\n54\t    - signal\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - boil\n57\t      - physics\n58\t      - -48.2\n59\t      - -12.6\n60\t      - 35.6\n61\t      - 0.6\n62\t      - 0.1\n63\t      - strong\n64\t    - - melt\n65\t      - physics\n66\t      - -52.1\n67\t      - -11.8\n68\t      - 40.3\n69\t      - 0.65\n70\t      - 0.08\n71\t      - strong\n72\t    - - change-state\n73\t      - physics\n74\t      - -50.8\n75\t      - -10.4\n76\t      - 40.4\n77\t      - 0.62\n78\t      - 0.1\n79\t      - strong\n80\t    - - freeze\n81\t      - physics\n82\t      - -45.6\n83\t      - -8.2\n84\t      - 37.4\n85\t      - 0.58\n86\t      - 0.06\n87\t      - strong\n88\t    - - use-thermometer\n89\t      - physics\n90\t      - -38.4\n91\t      - -5.0\n92\t      - 33.4\n93\t      - 0.5\n94\t      - 0.08\n95\t      - strong\n96\t    - - mix-chemicals\n97\t      - chemistry\n98\t      - -55.2\n99\t      - -14.8\n100\t      - 40.4\n101\t      - 0.68\n102\t      - 0.12\n103\t      - strong\n104\t    - - react-acid-base\n105\t      - chemistry\n106\t      - -46.0\n107\t      - -7.5\n108\t      - 38.5\n109\t      - 0.55\n110\t      - 0.08\n111\t      - strong\n112\t    - - mix-paint\n113\t      - chemistry\n114\t      - -32.5\n115\t      - -14.3\n116\t      - 18.2\n117\t      - 0.35\n118\t      - 0.12\n119\t      - moderate\n120\t    - - measure-melting-point\n121\t      - physics\n122\t      - -28.0\n123\t      - -8.6\n124\t      - 19.4\n125\t      - 0.3\n126\t      - 0.1\n127\t      - moderate\n128\t    - - conduct-electricity\n129\t      - physics\n130\t      - -25.8\n131\t      - -10.2\n132\t      - 15.6\n133\t      - 0.28\n134\t      - 0.08\n135\t      - moderate\n136\t    - - identify-life-stages\n137\t      - biology\n138\t      - -22.4\n139\t      - -2.6\n140\t      - 19.8\n141\t      - 0.25\n142\t      - 0.06\n143\t      - moderate\n144\t    - - grow-plant-basic\n145\t      - biology\n146\t      - -15.2\n147\t      - -8.9\n148\t      - 6.3\n149\t      - 0.12\n150\t      - 0.04\n151\t      - weak\n152\t    - - navigate-rooms\n153\t      - spatial\n154\t      - -10.4\n155\t      - -4.1\n156\t      - 6.3\n157\t      - 0.08\n158\t      - 0.02\n159\t      - weak\n160\t    - - grow-plant-advanced\n161\t      - biology\n162\t      - -8.6\n163\t      - -9.2\n164\t      - -0.6\n165\t      - 0.06\n166\t      - 0.04\n167\t      - none\n168\t    - - read-thermometer\n169\t      - physics\n170\t      - -5.2\n171\t      - -4.8\n172\t      - 0.4\n173\t      - 0.02\n174\t      - 0.02\n175\t      - none\n176\t    - - find-animal\n177\t      - ecology\n178\t      - -12.0\n179\t      - -13.5\n180\t      - -1.5\n181\t      - 0.04\n182\t      - 0.06\n183\t      - none\n184\t    - - classify-living\n185\t      - biology\n186\t      - -6.8\n187\t      - -8.0\n188\t      - -1.2\n189\t      - 0.02\n190\t      - 0.04\n191\t      - none\n192\t    - - ecology-food-web\n193\t      - ecology\n194\t      - -18.5\n195\t      - -20.1\n196\t      - -1.6\n197\t      - 0.1\n198\t      - 0.12\n199\t      - none\n200\t    - - identify-rocks\n201\t      - geology\n202\t      - -8.0\n203\t      - -7.5\n204\t      - 0.5\n205\t      - 0.04\n206\t      - 0.02\n207\t      - none\n208\t    - - use-microscope\n209\t      - biology\n210\t      - -4.2\n211\t      - -5.0\n212\t      - -0.8\n213\t      - 0.02\n214\t      - 0.02\n215\t      - none\n216\t  figures_description:\n217\t  - 'Bar chart: det_minus_internal per task type, colored by domain (physics=blue,\n218\t    chemistry=green, biology=orange, ecology=red, spatial=gray), horizontal line at\n219\t    0. Clear visual separation: physics/chemistry tasks cluster above +30, biology/ecology\n220\t    near 0 or negative.'\n221\t  analysis: '13/20 task types 通过信号筛选（≥5 分 det>internal 差距），与 median 档 task_types_with_significant_gain\n222\t    8-12 的预期一致 （部分 moderate/weak signal 在 full 20-episode 评估中可能跌出显著性）。 Domain 分布清晰：physics\n223\t    5/5 全部有信号，chemistry 3/3 全部有信号，biology 2/5 有信号，ecology 0/2 无信号。 这直接支持 median 档的\n224\t    A1 判断——death avoidance 增益集中在 physics/chemistry tasks。 No-signal tasks 将排除出 plan-001b，节约\n225\t    ~35% GPU 时间。\n226\t\n227\t    '\n228\t- name: Full Counterfactual Trajectory Collection\n229\t  plan_id: plan-001b\n230\t  description: '对 plan-001a 筛出的 13 个 signal-positive task types 各跑 20 episodes， 2-way\n231\t    counterfactual collection (internal + deterministic)，max_steps=30， 记录每步最优 modality\n232\t    的 hindsight labels。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    task_types_collected: 13\n237\t    episodes_per_task: 20\n238\t    total_episodes: 260\n239\t    total_steps_labeled: 6240\n240\t    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 38.5\n241\t    label_distribution_internal_pct: 61.5\n242\t    label_agreement_strong_tasks_pct: 82.0\n243\t    label_agreement_weak_tasks_pct: 64.0\n244\t    noisy_label_rate_overall_pct: 18.5\n245\t    avg_steps_per_episode: 24.0\n246\t    gpu_hours_actual: 23.5\n247\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 counterfactual labels 泛化中等（A4），具体表现为： 强信号 tasks (physics/chemistry)\n248\t    的 label agreement ~82%——大多数步骤中 deterministic 和 internal 的优劣清晰， 因为 death/survival\n249\t    差异提供了 binary signal。 弱信号 tasks 的 label agreement 仅 ~64%——很多步骤两种 modality 表现相近（都不死也都没进展），\n250\t    hindsight labeling 分不出哪个更好，导致标签噪声大。 整体 38.5% 步骤 labeled as deterministic-preferred，说明不是每步都需要\n251\t    safety net， 支持 selective routing 的必要性。但这个比例意味着 router 要学会一个相当细粒度的 per-step 判断。\n252\t    标签噪声 ~18.5% 将直接限制 router accuracy 的上限（A4），是 median 档 router accuracy 65-75% 的根本原因。\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  tables:\n256\t  - name: 'Table: Trajectory Collection Summary by Domain'\n257\t    columns:\n258\t    - domain\n259\t    - n_tasks\n260\t    - n_episodes\n261\t    - total_steps\n262\t    - pct_det_preferred\n263\t    - label_agreement_pct\n264\t    - avg_death_rate_internal\n265\t    rows:\n266\t    - - physics (strong)\n267\t      - 5\n268\t      - 100\n269\t      - 2450\n270\t      - 42.1\n271\t      - 84.5\n272\t      - 0.59\n273\t    - - chemistry (strong)\n274\t      - 2\n275\t      - 40\n276\t      - 960\n277\t      - 43.8\n278\t      - 79.0\n279\t      - 0.62\n280\t    - - physics (moderate)\n281\t      - 2\n282\t      - 40\n283\t      - 920\n284\t      - 33.2\n285\t      - 68.5\n286\t      - 0.29\n287\t    - - chemistry (moderate)\n288\t      - 1\n289\t      - 20\n290\t      - 480\n291\t      - 30.5\n292\t      - 72.0\n293\t      - 0.35\n294\t    - - biology (moderate)\n295\t      - 1\n296\t      - 20\n297\t      - 510\n298\t      - 28.0\n299\t      - 60.5\n300\t      - 0.25\n301\t    - - biology (weak)\n302\t      - 1\n303\t      - 20\n304\t      - 460\n305\t      - 22.4\n306\t      - 58.0\n307\t      - 0.12\n308\t    - - spatial (weak)\n309\t      - 1\n310\t      - 20\n311\t      - 460\n312\t      - 20.8\n313\t      - 55.0\n314\t      - 0.08\n315\t  figures_description:\n316\t  - 'Scatter plot: x=death_rate_internal, y=pct_det_preferred per task type. Strong\n317\t    positive correlation (r~0.85). 标注 task names. 直观展示 death avoidance 与 deterministic\n318\t    routing 需求的关联。'\n319\t  analysis: '~6240 个 labeled steps 为 router SFT 提供训练数据。标签质量的 domain-dependent 特征 预示了\n320\t    router 在不同 task domains 上性能将不均匀。强信号 tasks 提供高质量 labels (agreement>80%)， 弱信号 tasks\n321\t    的 labels 噪声高 (agreement<65%)，将直接反映在 plan-003 的 per-task-type breakdown 中。 det-preferred\n322\t    比例 38.5% 与 median 档 simulator_invocation_ratio 30-50% 一致。\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t- name: Router SFT Training\n326\t  plan_id: plan-002\n327\t  description: '在 plan-001b 的 counterfactual labels 上 fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B 做 2-way\n328\t    classification (internal vs deterministic)。Leave-one-out cross-validation by task\n329\t    type。\n330\t\n331\t    '\n332\t  expected_results:\n333\t    train_loss_final: 0.42\n334\t    val_accuracy_overall_pct: 71.2\n335\t    val_accuracy_strong_tasks_pct: 78.5\n336\t    val_accuracy_moderate_tasks_pct: 66.0\n337\t    val_accuracy_weak_tasks_pct: 58.3\n338\t    val_f1_deterministic: 0.68\n339\t    val_f1_internal: 0.74\n340\t    leave_one_out_accuracy_range:\n341\t    - 62.0\n342\t    - 76.0\n343\t    leave_one_out_mean_accuracy: 68.5\n344\t    best_epoch: 2\n345\t    convergence_epoch: 3\n346\t    gpu_hours_actual: 6.5\n347\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档 router accuracy 65-75% (A4)。整体 val accuracy 71.2% 符合此区间。\n348\t    强信号 tasks 的 labels 清晰（death/survival 二分），router 在这些 tasks 上学到了有效的 pattern， accuracy\n349\t    达 78.5%。弱信号 tasks 的标签噪声大，router accuracy 仅 58.3%——接近 random baseline (50%)。 Leave-one-out\n350\t    验证显示跨 task type 泛化中等（A4），range 62-76%： 留出 physics task 时其他 physics tasks 提供足够\n351\t    coverage，accuracy 高端 (~76%)； 留出 biology task 时几乎没有同 domain 训练数据，accuracy 低端 (~62%)。\n352\t    F1 score deterministic < internal 反映类别不平衡（38.5% vs 61.5%）和 deterministic labels\n353\t    更noisy。 Train loss 未过拟合（epoch 2-3 之间收敛），但 val accuracy 到 epoch 3 后不再提升， 说明瓶颈在标签质量而非模型容量。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t  tables:\n357\t  - name: 'Table: Router Training Metrics'\n358\t    columns:\n359\t    - metric\n360\t    - epoch_1\n361\t    - epoch_2\n362\t    - epoch_3\n363\t    rows:\n364\t    - - train_loss\n365\t      - 0.58\n366\t      - 0.45\n367\t      - 0.42\n368\t    - - val_loss\n369\t      - 0.55\n370\t      - 0.48\n371\t      - 0.47\n372\t    - - val_accuracy (%)\n373\t      - 64.8\n374\t      - 70.5\n375\t      - 71.2\n376\t    - - val_f1_det\n377\t      - 0.6\n378\t      - 0.67\n379\t      - 0.68\n380\t    - - val_f1_int\n381\t      - 0.68\n382\t      - 0.73\n383\t      - 0.74\n384\t  - name: 'Table: Leave-One-Out Cross-Validation (selected task types)'\n385\t    columns:\n386\t    - held_out_task\n387\t    - domain\n388\t    - accuracy_on_held_out (%)\n389\t    - accuracy_on_rest (%)\n390\t    rows:\n391\t    - - boil\n392\t      - physics\n393\t      - 76.0\n394\t      - 71.8\n395\t    - - melt\n396\t      - physics\n397\t      - 74.5\n398\t      - 71.5\n399\t    - - mix-chemicals\n400\t      - chemistry\n401\t      - 72.0\n402\t      - 71.0\n403\t    - - mix-paint\n404\t      - chemistry\n405\t      - 67.5\n406\t      - 72.0\n407\t    - - identify-life-stages\n408\t      - biology\n409\t      - 62.0\n410\t      - 72.5\n411\t    - - grow-plant-basic\n412\t      - biology\n413\t      - 63.5\n414\t      - 72.0\n415\t  figures_description:\n416\t  - 'Training curves: x=steps, y=loss/accuracy. Train loss (solid) vs val loss (dashed).\n417\t    Val accuracy plateaus at epoch 2.5. 标注 label noise ceiling (~75%) as horizontal\n418\t    dotted line.'\n419\t  analysis: 'Router 训练收敛稳定，但 accuracy 受限于标签噪声上限。71.2% 的 val accuracy 是 median 档的中间值。\n420\t    Leave-one-out 结果确认跨 task type 泛化中等——同 domain 迁移较好，跨 domain 较差。 这个 router 的主要价值在于\n421\t    physics/chemistry tasks 上的可靠判断， 弱 tasks 上的 routing decisions 接近 random 但因为这些 tasks\n422\t    本身 death rate 低，影响有限。\n423\t\n424\t    '\n425\t- name: SimGate End-to-End Evaluation\n426\t  plan_id: plan-003\n427\t  description: 'Trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone 在 held-out episodes 上端到端评估。 对比\n428\t    always-internal, always-deterministic, oracle-routing, random-routing, confidence-threshold\n429\t    heuristic。\n430\t\n431\t    '\n432\t  expected_results:\n433\t    simgate_score_overall: 78.2\n434\t    always_internal_score: 56.8\n435\t    always_deterministic_score: 70.5\n436\t    oracle_routing_score: 81.2\n437\t    random_routing_score: 63.4\n438\t    confidence_threshold_score: 66.8\n439\t    simgate_minus_always_internal: 21.4\n440\t    simgate_minus_always_deterministic: 7.7\n441\t    oracle_minus_simgate: 3.0\n442\t    oracle_minus_always_det: 10.7\n443\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 48.5\n444\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 22.3\n445\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 8.5\n446\t    catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct: 54.0\n447\t    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 41.2\n448\t    cogrouter_reported: 84.6\n449\t    itp_r_reported: 62.58\n450\t    simgate_minus_cogrouter: -6.4\n451\t    bootstrap_90ci_simgate:\n452\t    - 74.5\n453\t    - 81.8\n454\t    bootstrap_90ci_always_internal:\n455\t    - 52.0\n456\t    - 61.5\n457\t    bootstrap_90ci_always_det:\n458\t    - 66.2\n459\t    - 74.8\n460\t    task_types_with_significant_gain: 10\n461\t    gpu_hours_actual: 14.0\n462\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档 simgate_score_overall 72-84，取 78.2。未超过 CogRouter (84.6)\n463\t    但差距 6.4 分， 在 bootstrap CI 下两者 overlap（SimGate CI 上界 81.8 vs CogRouter 84.6），不能\n464\t    claim SOTA。 SimGate vs always-internal +21.4 分——核心 safety-net value，catastrophic\n465\t    failure 从 48.5% 降至 22.3%（降幅 54%）， 符合 median 档 catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct\n466\t    40-60%。 SimGate vs always-deterministic +7.7 分——selective routing 价值，说明并非所有步骤需要\n467\t    safety net， unconditional simulation 在低风险步骤引入了不必要的 rigid execution（LLM 在安全步骤上\n468\t    reasoning 更灵活）。 Oracle vs SimGate 仅 3.0 分——router 已捕获大部分可学习的 routing signal，剩余\n469\t    gap 来自弱 task types 的标签噪声。 Simulator invocation ratio 41.2%——router 在约 40% 步骤调用\n470\t    deterministic，远少于 always-det 的 100%， 说明 router 学到了 selective invocation pattern。\n471\t    对比 CogRouter 差距的原因：CogRouter 用 RL (CoPO) 在 trajectory 级别优化， SimGate 用 SFT per-step\n472\t    labels，且无 positive guidance signal (A6)——router 仅防死不指路。 10/13 task types 显著增益（physics\n473\t    5/5 + chemistry 3/3 + moderate 2/4）， 符合 median 档 task_types_with_significant_gain\n474\t    8-12。\n475\t\n476\t    '\n477\t  tables:\n478\t  - name: 'Table 1 (Main Results): SimGate vs Baselines on ScienceWorld'\n479\t    columns:\n480\t    - method\n481\t    - overall_score\n482\t    - 90% CI\n483\t    - catastrophic_failure_rate (%)\n484\t    - sim_invocation_ratio (%)\n485\t    - LLM_tokens (k)\n486\t    rows:\n487\t    - - Always-Internal\n488\t      - 56.8\n489\t      - '[52.0, 61.5]'\n490\t      - 48.5\n491\t      - 0\n492\t      - 385\n493\t    - - Always-Deterministic\n494\t      - 70.5\n495\t      - '[66.2, 74.8]'\n496\t      - 8.5\n497\t      - 100\n498\t      - 142\n499\t    - - Random Routing (p=0.4)\n500\t      - 63.4\n501\t      - '[58.8, 68.0]'\n502\t      - 30.2\n503\t      - 40.0\n504\t      - 248\n505\t    - - Confidence Threshold\n506\t      - 66.8\n507\t      - '[62.0, 71.5]'\n508\t      - 28.8\n509\t      - 35.5\n510\t      - 262\n511\t    - - SimGate (ours)\n512\t      - 78.2\n513\t      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n514\t      - 22.3\n515\t      - 41.2\n516\t      - 240\n517\t    - - Oracle Routing\n518\t      - 81.2\n519\t      - '[77.8, 84.5]'\n520\t      - 12.0\n521\t      - 36.5\n522\t      - 255\n523\t    - - '---'\n524\t      - '---'\n525\t      - '---'\n526\t      - '---'\n527\t      - '---'\n528\t      - '---'\n529\t    - - CogRouter (reported)\n530\t      - 84.6\n531\t      - —\n532\t      - —\n533\t      - —\n534\t      - —\n535\t    - - ITP-R (reported)\n536\t      - 62.58\n537\t      - —\n538\t      - —\n539\t      - —\n540\t      - —\n541\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Task-Type Breakdown (SimGate vs Always-Internal)'\n542\t    columns:\n543\t    - task_type\n544\t    - domain\n545\t    - simgate_score\n546\t    - internal_score\n547\t    - delta\n548\t    - catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct\n549\t    - significant\n550\t    rows:\n551\t    - - boil\n552\t      - physics\n553\t      - 82.5\n554\t      - 52.0\n555\t      - 30.5\n556\t      - 62\n557\t      - 'yes'\n558\t    - - melt\n559\t      - physics\n560\t      - 85.0\n561\t      - 48.5\n562\t      - 36.5\n563\t      - 68\n564\t      - 'yes'\n565\t    - - change-state\n566\t      - physics\n567\t      - 84.2\n568\t      - 50.2\n569\t      - 34.0\n570\t      - 65\n571\t      - 'yes'\n572\t    - - freeze\n573\t      - physics\n574\t      - 80.8\n575\t      - 55.0\n576\t      - 25.8\n577\t      - 58\n578\t      - 'yes'\n579\t    - - use-thermometer\n580\t      - physics\n581\t      - 78.0\n582\t      - 60.5\n583\t      - 17.5\n584\t      - 52\n585\t      - 'yes'\n586\t    - - mix-chemicals\n587\t      - chemistry\n588\t      - 82.0\n589\t      - 46.8\n590\t      - 35.2\n591\t      - 70\n592\t      - 'yes'\n593\t    - - react-acid-base\n594\t      - chemistry\n595\t      - 80.5\n596\t      - 52.5\n597\t      - 28.0\n598\t      - 60\n599\t      - 'yes'\n600\t    - - mix-paint\n601\t      - chemistry\n602\t      - 76.2\n603\t      - 62.0\n604\t      - 14.2\n605\t      - 42\n606\t      - 'yes'\n607\t    - - measure-melting-point\n608\t      - physics\n609\t      - 74.5\n610\t      - 65.0\n611\t      - 9.5\n612\t      - 35\n613\t      - 'yes'\n614\t    - - conduct-electricity\n615\t      - physics\n616\t      - 72.0\n617\t      - 60.5\n618\t      - 11.5\n619\t      - 38\n620\t      - 'yes'\n621\t    - - identify-life-stages\n622\t      - biology\n623\t      - 68.5\n624\t      - 62.0\n625\t      - 6.5\n626\t      - 22\n627\t      - 'no'\n628\t    - - grow-plant-basic\n629\t      - biology\n630\t      - 65.0\n631\t      - 60.5\n632\t      - 4.5\n633\t      - 15\n634\t      - 'no'\n635\t    - - navigate-rooms\n636\t      - spatial\n637\t      - 62.8\n638\t      - 58.0\n639\t      - 4.8\n640\t      - 12\n641\t      - 'no'\n642\t  figures_description:\n643\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: SimGate vs Always-Internal vs Always-Det vs Oracle per task\n644\t    type, sorted by delta. Physics/chemistry tasks cluster left with large deltas,\n645\t    biology/spatial tasks cluster right with small deltas.'\n646\t  - 'Scatter plot: x=catastrophic_failure_rate_internal, y=SimGate delta. Strong positive\n647\t    correlation, 标注 r=0.91. 直接可视化 ''death avoidance is primary mechanism'' claim.'\n648\t  analysis: 'SimGate 78.2 低于 CogRouter 84.6 约 6 分。叙事不能 claim SOTA，但 controlled ablation\n649\t    提供了强因果证据： SimGate vs internal (+21.4)、vs det (+7.7)、vs random (+14.8)、vs heuristic\n650\t    (+11.4) 全部显著。 catastrophic failure reduction 54% 是强 headline number。 Per-task\n651\t    breakdown 清晰展示 death avoidance 是主要机制——physics/chemistry 的 delta 与 internal death\n652\t    rate 高度相关 (r=0.91)。 3 个弱 tasks (biology/spatial) 的 delta <7 且不显著，支持 A1 的 domain-specific\n653\t    判断。 SimGate 比 CogRouter 差的原因可归为：(1) SFT vs RL training，(2) 无 positive guidance\n654\t    signal。 Paper 叙事应改为 \"first controlled study demonstrating causal role of deterministic\n655\t    computation in preventing catastrophic LLM failures\"。\n656\t\n657\t    '\n658\t- name: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation\n659\t  plan_id: plan-004\n660\t  description: '三条件对比：(a) 1.7B explicit router (SimGate), (b) 1.7B implicit router\n661\t    (SFT output [SIMULATE]), (c) 7B implicit routing (backbone tool-use prompt)。全部用相同\n662\t    counterfactual labels 训练。\n663\t\n664\t    '\n665\t  expected_results:\n666\t    explicit_1_7b_score: 78.2\n667\t    implicit_1_7b_score: 73.5\n668\t    implicit_7b_score: 74.8\n669\t    explicit_minus_implicit_1_7b: 4.7\n670\t    explicit_minus_implicit_7b: 3.4\n671\t    implicit_1_7b_catastrophic_failure_pct: 28.5\n672\t    implicit_7b_catastrophic_failure_pct: 26.2\n673\t    explicit_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 41.2\n674\t    implicit_1_7b_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 35.0\n675\t    implicit_7b_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 38.5\n676\t    bootstrap_90ci_explicit:\n677\t    - 74.5\n678\t    - 81.8\n679\t    bootstrap_90ci_implicit_1_7b:\n680\t    - 69.2\n681\t    - 77.8\n682\t    bootstrap_90ci_implicit_7b:\n683\t    - 70.5\n684\t    - 79.0\n685\t    explicit_vs_implicit_1_7b_significant: true\n686\t    explicit_vs_implicit_7b_significant: marginal (p=0.08)\n687\t    gpu_hours_actual: 11.0\n688\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档 explicit_minus_implicit 3-8 分，statistical significance\n689\t    在部分条件下边缘 (A3)。 Explicit 1.7B vs implicit 1.7B: +4.7 分，parameter-matched comparison\n690\t    显著 (p<0.05)。 这说明 explicit modular router 架构本身有价值——将 routing decision 从 generation\n691\t    中解耦， 避免了 implicit routing 中 generation 任务和 routing 任务的 multi-task interference。\n692\t    Explicit 1.7B vs implicit 7B: +3.4 分，但 CI overlap 大 (p=0.08，边缘显著)。 7B implicit\n693\t    比 1.7B implicit 好 1.3 分——额外容量有 marginal 帮助但不足以弥补架构劣势。 Implicit routers 的 sim_invocation_ratio\n694\t    偏低 (35-38.5% vs explicit 41.2%)—— implicit routing 倾向于 under-invoke simulator（routing\n695\t    signal 在 generation logits 中被稀释）， 导致更多 catastrophic failures 未被拦截。 这个 \"consistent\n696\t    but moderate advantage\" 的结果支持 C2 的定性 claim（interpretability, modularity） 而非强 performance\n697\t    claim。Median 档下 C2 的重心应转向： explicit router 可独立替换、routing decisions 可分析，这些定性价值在\n698\t    3-5 分性能差距之上额外成立。\n699\t\n700\t    '\n701\t  tables:\n702\t  - name: 'Table: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation'\n703\t    columns:\n704\t    - condition\n705\t    - params\n706\t    - overall_score\n707\t    - 90% CI\n708\t    - catastrophic_failure (%)\n709\t    - sim_invocation (%)\n710\t    - p vs explicit\n711\t    rows:\n712\t    - - Explicit Router (SimGate)\n713\t      - 1.7B\n714\t      - 78.2\n715\t      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n716\t      - 22.3\n717\t      - 41.2\n718\t      - —\n719\t    - - Implicit Router (SFT)\n720\t      - 1.7B\n721\t      - 73.5\n722\t      - '[69.2, 77.8]'\n723\t      - 28.5\n724\t      - 35.0\n725\t      - '0.03'\n726\t    - - Implicit Routing (tool-use)\n727\t      - 7B\n728\t      - 74.8\n729\t      - '[70.5, 79.0]'\n730\t      - 26.2\n731\t      - 38.5\n732\t      - '0.08'\n733\t    - - Always-Internal\n734\t      - —\n735\t      - 56.8\n736\t      - '[52.0, 61.5]'\n737\t      - 48.5\n738\t      - 0\n739\t      - <0.001\n740\t  figures_description:\n741\t  - 'Box plot: three conditions'' score distributions across task types. Explicit\n742\t    has higher median and tighter IQR. Annotate p-values for pairwise comparisons.'\n743\t  analysis: 'Parameter-matched comparison (1.7B explicit vs 1.7B implicit, +4.7, p=0.03)\n744\t    是 C2 最干净的证据。 7B implicit 条件 (p=0.08) 可写为 \"marginal significance\"，但方向一致。 Median\n745\t    档叙事：explicit routing 是 \"consistent but moderate advantage\"， 主要价值在 architectural\n746\t    benefits (modularity, interpretability, independent replacement)， 用 4.7 分的定量证据\n747\t    + 定性分析支撑。不能写成 \"large performance gap\"。\n748\t\n749\t    '\n750\t- name: Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis\n751\t  plan_id: plan-005\n752\t  description: '从 plan-003 输出分析 routing patterns：(a) 哪些 task types 触发 deterministic\n753\t    最多， (b) routing 集中在哪个 episode phase，(c) router-as-diagnostic-probe 识别 LLM failure\n754\t    modes。\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t  expected_results:\n758\t    n_routing_decisions_analyzed: 3900\n759\t    phase_early_det_pct: 25.0\n760\t    phase_mid_det_pct: 52.0\n761\t    phase_late_det_pct: 38.0\n762\t    physics_det_invocation_pct: 48.5\n763\t    chemistry_det_invocation_pct: 45.2\n764\t    biology_det_invocation_pct: 28.0\n765\t    spatial_det_invocation_pct: 22.0\n766\t    top_3_routing_triggers: state-change actions (heat/cool/mix), multi-step causal\n767\t      chains (>3 steps), post-failure recovery steps\n768\t    failure_mode_clusters_identified: 4\n769\t    cluster_clarity: moderate — 2 clear clusters, 2 diffuse\n770\t    gpu_hours_actual: 1.5\n771\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档 routing patterns 部分可解释 (A5)——能看到 phase-dependent 模式但\n772\t    failure taxonomy 不够清晰。 Phase-dependent pattern 清晰：mid-game (steps 8-20) routing\n773\t    最密集 (52%)， 因为这个阶段 agent 执行 state-changing actions (加热、冷却、混合) 最多， LLM 容易在多步物理推理中\n774\t    hallucinate 中间状态。 Early-game (steps 1-7) routing 较低 (25%)——agent 主要在 navigate\n775\t    和 gather objects，death 风险低。 Late-game (steps 21-30) routing 中等 (38%)——部分 tasks\n776\t    在此阶段做 final verification， 但也有很多 episodes 已经结束或 stuck。 4 个 failure mode clusters\n777\t    中： (1) \"thermal state tracking failure\" — 清晰，LLM 丢失温度/相态信息 (2) \"chemical reaction\n778\t    sequencing\" — 清晰，LLM 搞错反应步骤顺序 (3) \"multi-step causal confusion\" — 模糊，涵盖多种因果推理错误，不够\n779\t    specific (4) \"environment state drift\" — 模糊，router triggers 散布在各种步骤中 这是 median\n780\t    档 A5 的典型表现——有 pattern 但 failure taxonomy 不 clean。 Paper figure 只报告 phase-dependent\n781\t    routing trends，不宣称 comprehensive failure taxonomy。\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t  tables:\n785\t  - name: 'Table: Routing Decision Distribution by Episode Phase'\n786\t    columns:\n787\t    - phase\n788\t    - steps\n789\t    - total_decisions\n790\t    - det_routing_pct\n791\t    - avg_death_rate_if_internal\n792\t    rows:\n793\t    - - early\n794\t      - 1-7\n795\t      - 1200\n796\t      - 25.0\n797\t      - 0.12\n798\t    - - mid\n799\t      - 8-20\n800\t      - 1800\n801\t      - 52.0\n802\t      - 0.45\n803\t    - - late\n804\t      - 21-30\n805\t      - 900\n806\t      - 38.0\n807\t      - 0.28\n808\t  - name: 'Table: Failure Mode Clusters (Router-as-Diagnostic-Probe)'\n809\t    columns:\n810\t    - cluster\n811\t    - description\n812\t    - n_steps\n813\t    - pct_of_det_routing\n814\t    - clarity\n815\t    rows:\n816\t    - - 1\n817\t      - thermal state tracking failure\n818\t      - 420\n819\t      - 27.0\n820\t      - clear\n821\t    - - 2\n822\t      - chemical reaction sequencing error\n823\t      - 310\n824\t      - 20.0\n825\t      - clear\n826\t    - - 3\n827\t      - multi-step causal confusion\n828\t      - 480\n829\t      - 31.0\n830\t      - diffuse\n831\t    - - 4\n832\t      - environment state drift\n833\t      - 340\n834\t      - 22.0\n835\t      - diffuse\n836\t  figures_description:\n837\t  - 'Figure 1 (Paper): Routing heatmap — x=episode step (1-30), y=task type (sorted\n838\t    by domain). Color intensity = deterministic routing probability. Clear ''hot band''\n839\t    in mid-game steps for physics/chemistry tasks. Annotated with phase boundaries.'\n840\t  - 'Supplementary: t-SNE of router hidden states at deterministic-routing steps,\n841\t    colored by cluster ID. Clusters 1&2 tight, clusters 3&4 overlapping.'\n842\t  analysis: 'Phase-dependent routing trend 是 robust 的 finding，可以放 paper Figure 1。\n843\t    但 failure taxonomy 降级处理——从 \"failure mode taxonomy\" 改为 \"we observe routing concentrates\n844\t    at state-change actions during mid-game phases, suggesting the router learns to\n845\t    detect high-risk physical reasoning steps\"。不宣称 comprehensive failure analysis，只报告\n846\t    observable trends。 Mid-game concentration (52% of det routing) 直接对应 death avoidance\n847\t    mechanism—— 这正是 agent 执行 irreversible physical actions 的阶段。\n848\t\n849\t    '\n850\t- name: 2-Way vs 3-Way Routing Ablation\n851\t  plan_id: plan-006\n852\t  description: '补充 deep-internal modality 数据，比较 {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal,\n853\t    deep-internal, deterministic}。 测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有额外价值。\n854\t\n855\t    '\n856\t  expected_results:\n857\t    two_way_score: 78.2\n858\t    three_way_score: 79.8\n859\t    delta: 1.6\n860\t    p_value: 0.22\n861\t    significant: false\n862\t    three_way_sim_invocation_pct: 39.5\n863\t    three_way_deep_internal_pct: 18.0\n864\t    three_way_fast_internal_pct: 42.5\n865\t    supplemental_data_collection_hours: 5.5\n866\t    router_retraining_hours: 3.0\n867\t    gpu_hours_actual: 9.5\n868\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 3-way 与 2-way 差距小且不显著 (+1.6, p=0.22)。 Fast/deep internal\n869\t    区分的理论价值在于：deep-internal 在需要更多 reasoning 但不需要 ground-truth 的步骤上 用 extended thinking\n870\t    提升质量。但实际效果有限，原因： (1) death avoidance 是主要增益来源 (A6)——一旦 deterministic 拦截了 catastrophic\n871\t    failures， 剩余步骤中 fast vs deep internal 的差异很小（LLM 在安全步骤上的表现差异不大）。 (2) 没有 positive\n872\t    guidance signal——deep internal 不能给出更好的 task guidance，只是\"想更久\"， 但在 deterministic\n873\t    已经处理了高风险步骤后，多想对安全步骤帮助有限。 (3) Router 从 2-class 升到 3-class 增加了 classification 难度，在\n874\t    median 档标签噪声下性能提升被抵消。 结论：2-way 足够，simplifies the story。Paper 中可以一句话报告 \"binary\n875\t    routing (simulate-or-not) suffices; adding a third modality yields no significant\n876\t    improvement\"。\n877\t\n878\t    '\n879\t  tables:\n880\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Way vs 3-Way Routing Comparison'\n881\t    columns:\n882\t    - routing_scheme\n883\t    - overall_score\n884\t    - 90% CI\n885\t    - sim_invocation (%)\n886\t    - p vs 2-way\n887\t    rows:\n888\t    - - 2-way {int, det}\n889\t      - 78.2\n890\t      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n891\t      - 41.2\n892\t      - —\n893\t    - - 3-way {fast, deep, det}\n894\t      - 79.8\n895\t      - '[75.8, 83.5]'\n896\t      - 39.5\n897\t      - '0.22'\n898\t  figures_description:\n899\t  - 'Paired bar chart: 2-way vs 3-way per task type. Most bars nearly identical. 标注\n900\t    ns (not significant).'\n901\t  analysis: '3-way 不显著优于 2-way，simplifies the paper narrative。 可以 claim \"binary routing\n902\t    decision (simulate or not) captures the essential routing signal\"， 支持 safety-net\n903\t    framing——router 的核心工作是检测 high-risk steps，而非 fine-grained compute allocation。 在\n904\t    paper 中作为 ablation 一句话报告即可。这增加了实验密度而不改变结论。\n905\t\n906\t    '\n907\t- name: Boil Task Rerun with v3 Code\n908\t  plan_id: plan-007\n909\t  description: '用 v3 clean code（strict > tie-break, death filter only on internal）重跑\n910\t    boil task 20 episodes， 与 MVP 旧代码结果对比，确保分析一致性。\n911\t\n912\t    '\n913\t  expected_results:\n914\t    boil_v3_internal_mean: -46.5\n915\t    boil_v3_det_mean: -10.8\n916\t    boil_v3_oracle_mean: -3.2\n917\t    boil_v3_det_minus_internal: 35.7\n918\t    boil_v3_oracle_minus_det: 7.6\n919\t    boil_v3_bootstrap_90ci_det_minus_internal:\n920\t    - 22.0\n921\t    - 49.5\n922\t    boil_v3_death_rate_internal: 0.55\n923\t    boil_v3_death_rate_det: 0.08\n924\t    boil_mvp_internal_mean: -49.8\n925\t    boil_mvp_det_mean: -19.7\n926\t    delta_from_mvp_internal: 3.3\n927\t    delta_from_mvp_det: 8.9\n928\t    gpu_hours_actual: 2.5\n929\t  result_rationale: 'V3 code 的两个修正（strict > tie-break + death filter only on internal）对\n930\t    boil 的影响： (1) Strict > tie-break：减少了 deterministic 被选为 \"best\" 的 marginal cases，\n931\t    internal mean 略有提升 (-49.8 → -46.5) 因为部分原本 tie-break 判给 det 的 cases 现在留在 internal。\n932\t    (2) Death filter only on internal：det mean 显著提升 (-19.7 → -10.8) 因为 MVP 旧代码对 det\n933\t    也做了 death filter， 过滤掉了一些 det 原本能正确处理但被误判为 \"death\" 的 steps。 整体 det_minus_internal\n934\t    从 MVP 的 ~30 分变为 35.7 分，与 melt/change-state 的 ~40 分更接近， 说明 v3 code 修正消除了旧代码的 systematic\n935\t    bias。 Oracle mean 提升到 -3.2（接近 0），更符合预期——selective routing 应当接近 best-of-both。\n936\t\n937\t    '\n938\t  tables:\n939\t  - name: 'Table: Boil Task — v3 vs MVP Code Comparison'\n940\t    columns:\n941\t    - metric\n942\t    - MVP (old code)\n943\t    - v3 (clean code)\n944\t    - delta\n945\t    rows:\n946\t    - - internal_mean\n947\t      - -49.8\n948\t      - -46.5\n949\t      - '+3.3'\n950\t    - - det_mean\n951\t      - -19.7\n952\t      - -10.8\n953\t      - '+8.9'\n954\t    - - oracle_mean\n955\t      - -29.7\n956\t      - -3.2\n957\t      - '+26.5'\n958\t    - - det_minus_internal\n959\t      - 30.1\n960\t      - 35.7\n961\t      - '+5.6'\n962\t    - - death_rate_internal\n963\t      - ~0.6\n964\t      - 0.55\n965\t      - —\n966\t    - - death_rate_det\n967\t      - ~0.15\n968\t      - 0.08\n969\t      - —\n970\t  figures_description: []\n971\t  analysis: 'V3 code 修正提升了数据质量，特别是 oracle routing 从 -29.7 → -3.2 的大幅改善 说明旧 code 的\n972\t    death filter bug 严重低估了 selective routing 的价值。 修正后 boil 与其他 physics tasks (melt,\n973\t    change-state) 的 pattern 更一致， 全部 det_minus_internal 在 35-40 分范围。Paper 只使用 v3 数据。\n974\t\n975\t    '\n976\t- name: Router Size Ablation\n977\t  plan_id: plan-008\n978\t  description: '比较 Qwen3-1.7B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B vs Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router 的效果。 测试 router\n979\t    capacity 敏感性。\n980\t\n981\t    '\n982\t  expected_results:\n983\t    qwen3_1_7b_score: 78.2\n984\t    qwen2_5_1_5b_score: 76.0\n985\t    qwen2_5_3b_score: 79.0\n986\t    qwen3_1_7b_router_accuracy_pct: 71.2\n987\t    qwen2_5_1_5b_router_accuracy_pct: 67.5\n988\t    qwen2_5_3b_router_accuracy_pct: 73.0\n989\t    delta_1_5b_vs_1_7b: -2.2\n990\t    delta_3b_vs_1_7b: 0.8\n991\t    significant_1_5b_vs_1_7b: false\n992\t    significant_3b_vs_1_7b: false\n993\t    inference_latency_1_5b_ms: 12\n994\t    inference_latency_1_7b_ms: 15\n995\t    inference_latency_3b_ms: 28\n996\t    gpu_hours_actual: 10.0\n997\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 router 性能受限于 label noise 而非 model capacity (plan-002\n998\t    分析已显示)。 1.5B vs 1.7B: -2.2 分但不显著 (p>0.1)——1.5B 容量略不足以 capture 一些 edge case routing\n999\t    patterns， 但差距在标签噪声范围内。Router accuracy 67.5% vs 71.2%，差距主要在 moderate/weak signal\n1000\t    tasks。 3B vs 1.7B: +0.8 分不显著——额外容量无法突破标签噪声上限。Router accuracy 73% vs 71.2%， marginal\n1001\t    improvement 被 end-to-end evaluation 的 variance 吞没。 这支持 \"lightweight router suffices\"\n1002\t    claim：1.5B-3B 范围内性能差异 <3 分， 瓶颈在训练数据质量而非 router capacity。 Inference latency 差异对\n1003\t    overall pipeline 影响 negligible（router inference 远快于 LLM backbone inference）。\n1004\t\n1005\t    '\n1006\t  tables:\n1007\t  - name: 'Table: Router Size Ablation'\n1008\t    columns:\n1009\t    - router\n1010\t    - params\n1011\t    - router_accuracy (%)\n1012\t    - e2e_score\n1013\t    - 90% CI\n1014\t    - latency (ms)\n1015\t    rows:\n1016\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n1017\t      - 1.5B\n1018\t      - 67.5\n1019\t      - 76.0\n1020\t      - '[71.8, 80.2]'\n1021\t      - 12\n1022\t    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n1023\t      - 1.7B\n1024\t      - 71.2\n1025\t      - 78.2\n1026\t      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n1027\t      - 15\n1028\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n1029\t      - 3.0B\n1030\t      - 73.0\n1031\t      - 79.0\n1032\t      - '[75.2, 82.8]'\n1033\t      - 28\n1034\t  figures_description:\n1035\t  - 'Line plot: x=router params (log scale), y=e2e score. Near-flat line with error\n1036\t    bars overlapping. 标注 ''label noise ceiling'' as horizontal band.'\n1037\t  analysis: 'Router size ablation 支持两个 claims：(1) 小 router 足够 (\"lightweight\" in C2)，\n1038\t    (2) 瓶颈在标签质量——增加 router capacity 收益递减。 Paper 可报告 \"routers from 1.5B to 3B parameters\n1039\t    achieve comparable performance (76-79), suggesting the routing task is learnable\n1040\t    at modest scale\"。\n1041\t\n1042\t    '\n1043\t- name: MATH Track — Code Interpreter as Oracle\n1044\t  plan_id: plan-009\n1045\t  description: '500 道 Level 4-5 MATH 题，2-way routing: internal / code-interpreter。\n1046\t    测试 safety-aware routing 是否泛化到代码解释器场景。\n1047\t\n1048\t    '\n1049\t  expected_results:\n1050\t    simgate_math_accuracy_pct: 62.5\n1051\t    always_internal_accuracy_pct: 55.0\n1052\t    always_code_accuracy_pct: 58.8\n1053\t    oracle_routing_accuracy_pct: 68.0\n1054\t    simgate_minus_internal: 7.5\n1055\t    simgate_minus_always_code: 3.7\n1056\t    code_invocation_ratio_pct: 45.0\n1057\t    router_accuracy_math_pct: 63.0\n1058\t    catastrophic_error_reduction_pct: 28.0\n1059\t    gpu_hours_actual: 18.0\n1060\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 MATH track 显示中等泛化 (A4)。 Safety-aware routing 在 MATH\n1061\t    上的增益 (+7.5 vs internal) 远小于 ScienceWorld (+21.4)，原因： (1) MATH 没有 -100 death penalty——错误只是\n1062\t    0 分而非 catastrophic failure， safety-net 机制的 value proposition 减弱。 (2) Code interpreter\n1063\t    的优势在于 arithmetic/algebraic computation，不在于 \"preventing catastrophic failures\"。\n1064\t    LLM 在 MATH 上的错误模式更分散（reasoning errors, not just computation errors）， code interpreter\n1065\t    只能修正 computation errors 这一子集。 (3) Router 的 ScienceWorld labels 无法直接迁移，MATH 上需要\n1066\t    fresh labels， 但 label quality 更差——hindsight labeling 在 MATH 上不如 ScienceWorld 清晰（没有\n1067\t    death/survival 信号）。 Router accuracy 仅 63%（低于 ScienceWorld 71.2%），进一步说明 routing\n1068\t    signal 在 MATH 上更弱。 Catastrophic error reduction 仅 28%——定义 catastrophic 为 \"算错导致\n1069\t    0 分\"， code interpreter 能防止部分但远非全部。 这个结果仍有 paper 价值：证明 selective routing 原则泛化 (simgate\n1070\t    > always-code > always-internal)， 但 safety-aware framing 在无 catastrophic penalty\n1071\t    的环境中 weakens。可作为 discussion/future work 素材。\n1072\t\n1073\t    '\n1074\t  tables:\n1075\t  - name: 'Table: MATH Track Results (Level 4-5, n=500)'\n1076\t    columns:\n1077\t    - method\n1078\t    - accuracy (%)\n1079\t    - code_invocation (%)\n1080\t    - computation_error_rate (%)\n1081\t    rows:\n1082\t    - - Always-Internal\n1083\t      - 55.0\n1084\t      - 0\n1085\t      - 18.5\n1086\t    - - Always-Code\n1087\t      - 58.8\n1088\t      - 100\n1089\t      - 5.2\n1090\t    - - SimGate Router\n1091\t      - 62.5\n1092\t      - 45.0\n1093\t      - 10.8\n1094\t    - - Oracle Routing\n1095\t      - 68.0\n1096\t      - 38.0\n1097\t      - 3.0\n1098\t  figures_description:\n1099\t  - 'Bar chart: MATH results alongside ScienceWorld results (normalized). Clear visual:\n1100\t    ScienceWorld gains much larger. 标注 ''catastrophic penalty effect''.'\n1101\t  analysis: 'MATH 结果支持 selective > unconditional 的一般原则但效果弱得多。 如果 paper 长度允许，可以作为一段\n1102\t    \"Generalization\" 讨论； 如果 4-page 紧张，放 appendix 或 future work 一句话提及。 关键 takeaway：\"safety-aware\n1103\t    routing gains are proportional to the severity of catastrophic failure penalties\"。\n1104\t\n1105\t    '\n1106\t- name: Cross-Task Transfer within ScienceWorld\n1107\t  plan_id: plan-010\n1108\t  description: 'Chemistry-only 训练 → physics 评估，physics-only 训练 → chemistry 评估。 测试\n1109\t    routing patterns 跨 domain 迁移性。\n1110\t\n1111\t    '\n1112\t  expected_results:\n1113\t    chem_train_chem_eval_score: 79.5\n1114\t    chem_train_phys_eval_score: 72.8\n1115\t    phys_train_phys_eval_score: 80.0\n1116\t    phys_train_chem_eval_score: 71.5\n1117\t    transfer_degradation_chem_to_phys: 7.2\n1118\t    transfer_degradation_phys_to_chem: 8.0\n1119\t    full_train_phys_eval_score: 82.5\n1120\t    full_train_chem_eval_score: 82.0\n1121\t    cross_domain_router_accuracy_pct: 62.5\n1122\t    same_domain_router_accuracy_pct: 76.0\n1123\t    gpu_hours_actual: 4.5\n1124\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档 routing pattern 迁移中等 (A4/A5)。 Chemistry → physics 迁移降幅\n1125\t    7.2 分，physics → chemistry 降幅 8.0 分—— 大约 40-50% 的 routing knowledge 可以跨 domain\n1126\t    迁移。 原因：death avoidance 的部分 pattern 是 domain-generic 的 （如 \"state-change actions\n1127\t    需要 deterministic verification\"）——这个 high-level 模式在两个 domain 共享。 但 domain-specific\n1128\t    failure patterns（如 chemistry 的 reaction sequencing vs physics 的 thermal tracking）\n1129\t    不迁移，导致 cross-domain router accuracy 从 76% 降到 62.5%。 这个结果在 paper 中可以作为一段 analysis：\"routing\n1130\t    patterns partially transfer across task domains sharing similar physical reasoning\n1131\t    requirements, but domain-specific failure modes require domain-specific training\n1132\t    data\"。 不需要改变 main claims，但增加了对 router generalization 的理解。\n1133\t\n1134\t    '\n1135\t  tables:\n1136\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Task Transfer Matrix'\n1137\t    columns:\n1138\t    - train_domain\n1139\t    - eval_domain\n1140\t    - score\n1141\t    - router_accuracy (%)\n1142\t    - vs full-train delta\n1143\t    rows:\n1144\t    - - chemistry\n1145\t      - chemistry\n1146\t      - 79.5\n1147\t      - 78.0\n1148\t      - '-2.5'\n1149\t    - - chemistry\n1150\t      - physics\n1151\t      - 72.8\n1152\t      - 62.5\n1153\t      - '-9.7'\n1154\t    - - physics\n1155\t      - physics\n1156\t      - 80.0\n1157\t      - 77.5\n1158\t      - '-2.5'\n1159\t    - - physics\n1160\t      - chemistry\n1161\t      - 71.5\n1162\t      - 61.0\n1163\t      - '-10.5'\n1164\t    - - all\n1165\t      - physics\n1166\t      - 82.5\n1167\t      - 78.5\n1168\t      - —\n1169\t    - - all\n1170\t      - chemistry\n1171\t      - 82.0\n1172\t      - 79.0\n1173\t      - —\n1174\t  figures_description:\n1175\t  - 'Transfer matrix heatmap: 2x2 grid showing score degradation. Diagonal (same-domain)\n1176\t    brighter, off-diagonal darker but not black — partial transfer.'\n1177\t  analysis: ~40-50% routing knowledge 跨 domain 迁移，与 median 档 A4 (counterfactual labels\n1178\t    泛化中等) 一致。 如果 4-page 紧张，这个实验可以仅在 results 最后一段用 2 句话概括。 重要 insight：routing 的 domain-generic\n1179\t    component 是 \"detect state-change actions under uncertainty\"， 这个 framing 比 task-specific\n1180\t    failure taxonomy 更 generalizable。\n1181\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8e8fc79-eab1-46af-a030-1a02fcf2d909","uuid":"ef0b91e2-f116-45b3-9675-5a9116b28eb5","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:10:37.890Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_12/projects/simgate-modular-routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T153257/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '整体叙事从 \"new SOTA via safety-aware routing\" 转向 \"first explicit\n  study of when deterministic computation helps LLM agents, with controlled causal\n  evidence\"。 C1 不与 CogRouter 直接比 SOTA，改为强调 SimGate vs 自身 ablation baselines 的受控实验，headline\n  为 \"reduces catastrophic failures by ~50%\"。 C2 explicit vs implicit 差距写成 \"consistent\n  but moderate advantage\"，重心转向 interpretability/modularity 的定性价值。 routing pattern\n  分析从 failure mode taxonomy 降为 phase-dependent routing trends。 补充 plan-006 (2-way\n  vs 3-way) 增加实验密度弥补 headline number 不够突出的不足。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Mini Signal Detection (Pre-screening)\n  plan_id: plan-001a\n  description: '对 ~20 个 ScienceWorld task type 各跑 5 episodes，2-way (internal + deterministic)，\n    筛选出 det > internal 的 task types 进入 plan-001b。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_task_types_screened: 20\n    signal_positive_task_types: 13\n    strong_signal_types: 7\n    moderate_signal_types: 4\n    weak_signal_types: 2\n    no_signal_types: 7\n    strong_signal_list: boil, melt, change-state-of-matter, freeze, use-thermometer,\n      mix-chemicals, react-acid-base\n    moderate_signal_list: mix-paint, measure-melting-point, conduct-electricity, identify-life-stages\n    weak_signal_list: grow-plant-basic, navigate-rooms\n    no_signal_example: grow-plant-advanced, read-thermometer, find-animal, classify-living,\n      ecology-food-web, identify-rocks, use-microscope\n    mean_det_minus_internal_strong: 38.5\n    mean_det_minus_internal_moderate: 18.2\n    mean_det_minus_internal_weak: 6.3\n    gpu_hours_actual: 9.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 death avoidance 是主要增益来源但集中在 physics/chemistry tasks。\n    涉及温度变化、相态转换、化学反应的 7 个 task type 展示强信号（det-internal ~35-45 分）， 因为 LLM 在多步物理推理中频繁\n    hallucinate 状态导致 death (-100)，deterministic oracle 消除了这些 catastrophic failures。\n    4 个 moderate signal tasks 有部分物理/化学子步骤但非全程依赖，增益在 10-25 分。 2 个 weak signal tasks\n    动作空间简单、death 风险低，deterministic 的 safety-net 价值有限。 7 个 no-signal tasks（生态观察、分类、阅读类）几乎无\n    death 惩罚，internal reasoning 本身足够， det invocation 反而引入不必要的 rigid execution，无法利用\n    LLM 的灵活推理优势。 这个 13/20 的通过率说明 safety-aware routing 不是 universal solution，而是 domain-specific\n    mechanism。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal Pre-screening Results (5 episodes per task type)'\n    columns:\n    - task_type\n    - domain\n    - internal_mean\n    - det_mean\n    - det_minus_internal\n    - death_rate_internal\n    - death_rate_det\n    - signal\n    rows:\n    - - boil\n      - physics\n      - -48.2\n      - -12.6\n      - 35.6\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.1\n      - strong\n    - - melt\n      - physics\n      - -52.1\n      - -11.8\n      - 40.3\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.08\n      - strong\n    - - change-state\n      - physics\n      - -50.8\n      - -10.4\n      - 40.4\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.1\n      - strong\n    - - freeze\n      - physics\n      - -45.6\n      - -8.2\n      - 37.4\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.06\n      - strong\n    - - use-thermometer\n      - physics\n      - -38.4\n      - -5.0\n      - 33.4\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.08\n      - strong\n    - - mix-chemicals\n      - chemistry\n      - -55.2\n      - -14.8\n      - 40.4\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.12\n      - strong\n    - - react-acid-base\n      - chemistry\n      - -46.0\n      - -7.5\n      - 38.5\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.08\n      - strong\n    - - mix-paint\n      - chemistry\n      - -32.5\n      - -14.3\n      - 18.2\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.12\n      - moderate\n    - - measure-melting-point\n      - physics\n      - -28.0\n      - -8.6\n      - 19.4\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1\n      - moderate\n    - - conduct-electricity\n      - physics\n      - -25.8\n      - -10.2\n      - 15.6\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.08\n      - moderate\n    - - identify-life-stages\n      - biology\n      - -22.4\n      - -2.6\n      - 19.8\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.06\n      - moderate\n    - - grow-plant-basic\n      - biology\n      - -15.2\n      - -8.9\n      - 6.3\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.04\n      - weak\n    - - navigate-rooms\n      - spatial\n      - -10.4\n      - -4.1\n      - 6.3\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.02\n      - weak\n    - - grow-plant-advanced\n      - biology\n      - -8.6\n      - -9.2\n      - -0.6\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.04\n      - none\n    - - read-thermometer\n      - physics\n      - -5.2\n      - -4.8\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.02\n      - none\n    - - find-animal\n      - ecology\n      - -12.0\n      - -13.5\n      - -1.5\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.06\n      - none\n    - - classify-living\n      - biology\n      - -6.8\n      - -8.0\n      - -1.2\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.04\n      - none\n    - - ecology-food-web\n      - ecology\n      - -18.5\n      - -20.1\n      - -1.6\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.12\n      - none\n    - - identify-rocks\n      - geology\n      - -8.0\n      - -7.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.02\n      - none\n    - - use-microscope\n      - biology\n      - -4.2\n      - -5.0\n      - -0.8\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.02\n      - none\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: det_minus_internal per task type, colored by domain (physics=blue,\n    chemistry=green, biology=orange, ecology=red, spatial=gray), horizontal line at\n    0. Clear visual separation: physics/chemistry tasks cluster above +30, biology/ecology\n    near 0 or negative.'\n  analysis: '13/20 task types 通过信号筛选（≥5 分 det>internal 差距），与 median 档 task_types_with_significant_gain\n    8-12 的预期一致 （部分 moderate/weak signal 在 full 20-episode 评估中可能跌出显著性）。 Domain 分布清晰：physics\n    5/5 全部有信号，chemistry 3/3 全部有信号，biology 2/5 有信号，ecology 0/2 无信号。 这直接支持 median 档的\n    A1 判断——death avoidance 增益集中在 physics/chemistry tasks。 No-signal tasks 将排除出 plan-001b，节约\n    ~35% GPU 时间。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Counterfactual Trajectory Collection\n  plan_id: plan-001b\n  description: '对 plan-001a 筛出的 13 个 signal-positive task types 各跑 20 episodes， 2-way\n    counterfactual collection (internal + deterministic)，max_steps=30， 记录每步最优 modality\n    的 hindsight labels。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    task_types_collected: 13\n    episodes_per_task: 20\n    total_episodes: 260\n    total_steps_labeled: 6240\n    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 38.5\n    label_distribution_internal_pct: 61.5\n    label_agreement_strong_tasks_pct: 82.0\n    label_agreement_weak_tasks_pct: 64.0\n    noisy_label_rate_overall_pct: 18.5\n    avg_steps_per_episode: 24.0\n    gpu_hours_actual: 23.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 counterfactual labels 泛化中等（A4），具体表现为： 强信号 tasks (physics/chemistry)\n    的 label agreement ~82%——大多数步骤中 deterministic 和 internal 的优劣清晰， 因为 death/survival\n    差异提供了 binary signal。 弱信号 tasks 的 label agreement 仅 ~64%——很多步骤两种 modality 表现相近（都不死也都没进展），\n    hindsight labeling 分不出哪个更好，导致标签噪声大。 整体 38.5% 步骤 labeled as deterministic-preferred，说明不是每步都需要\n    safety net， 支持 selective routing 的必要性。但这个比例意味着 router 要学会一个相当细粒度的 per-step 判断。\n    标签噪声 ~18.5% 将直接限制 router accuracy 的上限（A4），是 median 档 router accuracy 65-75% 的根本原因。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Trajectory Collection Summary by Domain'\n    columns:\n    - domain\n    - n_tasks\n    - n_episodes\n    - total_steps\n    - pct_det_preferred\n    - label_agreement_pct\n    - avg_death_rate_internal\n    rows:\n    - - physics (strong)\n      - 5\n      - 100\n      - 2450\n      - 42.1\n      - 84.5\n      - 0.59\n    - - chemistry (strong)\n      - 2\n      - 40\n      - 960\n      - 43.8\n      - 79.0\n      - 0.62\n    - - physics (moderate)\n      - 2\n      - 40\n      - 920\n      - 33.2\n      - 68.5\n      - 0.29\n    - - chemistry (moderate)\n      - 1\n      - 20\n      - 480\n      - 30.5\n      - 72.0\n      - 0.35\n    - - biology (moderate)\n      - 1\n      - 20\n      - 510\n      - 28.0\n      - 60.5\n      - 0.25\n    - - biology (weak)\n      - 1\n      - 20\n      - 460\n      - 22.4\n      - 58.0\n      - 0.12\n    - - spatial (weak)\n      - 1\n      - 20\n      - 460\n      - 20.8\n      - 55.0\n      - 0.08\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: x=death_rate_internal, y=pct_det_preferred per task type. Strong\n    positive correlation (r~0.85). 标注 task names. 直观展示 death avoidance 与 deterministic\n    routing 需求的关联。'\n  analysis: '~6240 个 labeled steps 为 router SFT 提供训练数据。标签质量的 domain-dependent 特征 预示了\n    router 在不同 task domains 上性能将不均匀。强信号 tasks 提供高质量 labels (agreement>80%)， 弱信号 tasks\n    的 labels 噪声高 (agreement<65%)，将直接反映在 plan-003 的 per-task-type breakdown 中。 det-preferred\n    比例 38.5% 与 median 档 simulator_invocation_ratio 30-50% 一致。\n\n    '\n- name: Router SFT Training\n  plan_id: plan-002\n  description: '在 plan-001b 的 counterfactual labels 上 fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B 做 2-way\n    classification (internal vs deterministic)。Leave-one-out cross-validation by task\n    type。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    train_loss_final: 0.42\n    val_accuracy_overall_pct: 71.2\n    val_accuracy_strong_tasks_pct: 78.5\n    val_accuracy_moderate_tasks_pct: 66.0\n    val_accuracy_weak_tasks_pct: 58.3\n    val_f1_deterministic: 0.68\n    val_f1_internal: 0.74\n    leave_one_out_accuracy_range:\n    - 62.0\n    - 76.0\n    leave_one_out_mean_accuracy: 68.5\n    best_epoch: 2\n    convergence_epoch: 3\n    gpu_hours_actual: 6.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档 router accuracy 65-75% (A4)。整体 val accuracy 71.2% 符合此区间。\n    强信号 tasks 的 labels 清晰（death/survival 二分），router 在这些 tasks 上学到了有效的 pattern， accuracy\n    达 78.5%。弱信号 tasks 的标签噪声大，router accuracy 仅 58.3%——接近 random baseline (50%)。 Leave-one-out\n    验证显示跨 task type 泛化中等（A4），range 62-76%： 留出 physics task 时其他 physics tasks 提供足够\n    coverage，accuracy 高端 (~76%)； 留出 biology task 时几乎没有同 domain 训练数据，accuracy 低端 (~62%)。\n    F1 score deterministic < internal 反映类别不平衡（38.5% vs 61.5%）和 deterministic labels\n    更noisy。 Train loss 未过拟合（epoch 2-3 之间收敛），但 val accuracy 到 epoch 3 后不再提升， 说明瓶颈在标签质量而非模型容量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Router Training Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - epoch_1\n    - epoch_2\n    - epoch_3\n    rows:\n    - - train_loss\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.42\n    - - val_loss\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.47\n    - - val_accuracy (%)\n      - 64.8\n      - 70.5\n      - 71.2\n    - - val_f1_det\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.68\n    - - val_f1_int\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.74\n  - name: 'Table: Leave-One-Out Cross-Validation (selected task types)'\n    columns:\n    - held_out_task\n    - domain\n    - accuracy_on_held_out (%)\n    - accuracy_on_rest (%)\n    rows:\n    - - boil\n      - physics\n      - 76.0\n      - 71.8\n    - - melt\n      - physics\n      - 74.5\n      - 71.5\n    - - mix-chemicals\n      - chemistry\n      - 72.0\n      - 71.0\n    - - mix-paint\n      - chemistry\n      - 67.5\n      - 72.0\n    - - identify-life-stages\n      - biology\n      - 62.0\n      - 72.5\n    - - grow-plant-basic\n      - biology\n      - 63.5\n      - 72.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Training curves: x=steps, y=loss/accuracy. Train loss (solid) vs val loss (dashed).\n    Val accuracy plateaus at epoch 2.5. 标注 label noise ceiling (~75%) as horizontal\n    dotted line.'\n  analysis: 'Router 训练收敛稳定，但 accuracy 受限于标签噪声上限。71.2% 的 val accuracy 是 median 档的中间值。\n    Leave-one-out 结果确认跨 task type 泛化中等——同 domain 迁移较好，跨 domain 较差。 这个 router 的主要价值在于\n    physics/chemistry tasks 上的可靠判断， 弱 tasks 上的 routing decisions 接近 random 但因为这些 tasks\n    本身 death rate 低，影响有限。\n\n    '\n- name: SimGate End-to-End Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan-003\n  description: 'Trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone 在 held-out episodes 上端到端评估。 对比\n    always-internal, always-deterministic, oracle-routing, random-routing, confidence-threshold\n    heuristic。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simgate_score_overall: 78.2\n    always_internal_score: 56.8\n    always_deterministic_score: 70.5\n    oracle_routing_score: 81.2\n    random_routing_score: 63.4\n    confidence_threshold_score: 66.8\n    simgate_minus_always_internal: 21.4\n    simgate_minus_always_deterministic: 7.7\n    oracle_minus_simgate: 3.0\n    oracle_minus_always_det: 10.7\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 48.5\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 22.3\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 8.5\n    catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct: 54.0\n    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 41.2\n    cogrouter_reported: 84.6\n    itp_r_reported: 62.58\n    simgate_minus_cogrouter: -6.4\n    bootstrap_90ci_simgate:\n    - 74.5\n    - 81.8\n    bootstrap_90ci_always_internal:\n    - 52.0\n    - 61.5\n    bootstrap_90ci_always_det:\n    - 66.2\n    - 74.8\n    task_types_with_significant_gain: 10\n    gpu_hours_actual: 14.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档 simgate_score_overall 72-84，取 78.2。未超过 CogRouter (84.6)\n    但差距 6.4 分， 在 bootstrap CI 下两者 overlap（SimGate CI 上界 81.8 vs CogRouter 84.6），不能\n    claim SOTA。 SimGate vs always-internal +21.4 分——核心 safety-net value，catastrophic\n    failure 从 48.5% 降至 22.3%（降幅 54%）， 符合 median 档 catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct\n    40-60%。 SimGate vs always-deterministic +7.7 分——selective routing 价值，说明并非所有步骤需要\n    safety net， unconditional simulation 在低风险步骤引入了不必要的 rigid execution（LLM 在安全步骤上\n    reasoning 更灵活）。 Oracle vs SimGate 仅 3.0 分——router 已捕获大部分可学习的 routing signal，剩余\n    gap 来自弱 task types 的标签噪声。 Simulator invocation ratio 41.2%——router 在约 40% 步骤调用\n    deterministic，远少于 always-det 的 100%， 说明 router 学到了 selective invocation pattern。\n    对比 CogRouter 差距的原因：CogRouter 用 RL (CoPO) 在 trajectory 级别优化， SimGate 用 SFT per-step\n    labels，且无 positive guidance signal (A6)——router 仅防死不指路。 10/13 task types 显著增益（physics\n    5/5 + chemistry 3/3 + moderate 2/4）， 符合 median 档 task_types_with_significant_gain\n    8-12。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1 (Main Results): SimGate vs Baselines on ScienceWorld'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - overall_score\n    - 90% CI\n    - catastrophic_failure_rate (%)\n    - sim_invocation_ratio (%)\n    - LLM_tokens (k)\n    rows:\n    - - Always-Internal\n      - 56.8\n      - '[52.0, 61.5]'\n      - 48.5\n      - 0\n      - 385\n    - - Always-Deterministic\n      - 70.5\n      - '[66.2, 74.8]'\n      - 8.5\n      - 100\n      - 142\n    - - Random Routing (p=0.4)\n      - 63.4\n      - '[58.8, 68.0]'\n      - 30.2\n      - 40.0\n      - 248\n    - - Confidence Threshold\n      - 66.8\n      - '[62.0, 71.5]'\n      - 28.8\n      - 35.5\n      - 262\n    - - SimGate (ours)\n      - 78.2\n      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n      - 22.3\n      - 41.2\n      - 240\n    - - Oracle Routing\n      - 81.2\n      - '[77.8, 84.5]'\n      - 12.0\n      - 36.5\n      - 255\n    - - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n    - - CogRouter (reported)\n      - 84.6\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - ITP-R (reported)\n      - 62.58\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Task-Type Breakdown (SimGate vs Always-Internal)'\n    columns:\n    - task_type\n    - domain\n    - simgate_score\n    - internal_score\n    - delta\n    - catastrophic_failure_reduction_pct\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - boil\n      - physics\n      - 82.5\n      - 52.0\n      - 30.5\n      - 62\n      - 'yes'\n    - - melt\n      - physics\n      - 85.0\n      - 48.5\n      - 36.5\n      - 68\n      - 'yes'\n    - - change-state\n      - physics\n      - 84.2\n      - 50.2\n      - 34.0\n      - 65\n      - 'yes'\n    - - freeze\n      - physics\n      - 80.8\n      - 55.0\n      - 25.8\n      - 58\n      - 'yes'\n    - - use-thermometer\n      - physics\n      - 78.0\n      - 60.5\n      - 17.5\n      - 52\n      - 'yes'\n    - - mix-chemicals\n      - chemistry\n      - 82.0\n      - 46.8\n      - 35.2\n      - 70\n      - 'yes'\n    - - react-acid-base\n      - chemistry\n      - 80.5\n      - 52.5\n      - 28.0\n      - 60\n      - 'yes'\n    - - mix-paint\n      - chemistry\n      - 76.2\n      - 62.0\n      - 14.2\n      - 42\n      - 'yes'\n    - - measure-melting-point\n      - physics\n      - 74.5\n      - 65.0\n      - 9.5\n      - 35\n      - 'yes'\n    - - conduct-electricity\n      - physics\n      - 72.0\n      - 60.5\n      - 11.5\n      - 38\n      - 'yes'\n    - - identify-life-stages\n      - biology\n      - 68.5\n      - 62.0\n      - 6.5\n      - 22\n      - 'no'\n    - - grow-plant-basic\n      - biology\n      - 65.0\n      - 60.5\n      - 4.5\n      - 15\n      - 'no'\n    - - navigate-rooms\n      - spatial\n      - 62.8\n      - 58.0\n      - 4.8\n      - 12\n      - 'no'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: SimGate vs Always-Internal vs Always-Det vs Oracle per task\n    type, sorted by delta. Physics/chemistry tasks cluster left with large deltas,\n    biology/spatial tasks cluster right with small deltas.'\n  - 'Scatter plot: x=catastrophic_failure_rate_internal, y=SimGate delta. Strong positive\n    correlation, 标注 r=0.91. 直接可视化 ''death avoidance is primary mechanism'' claim.'\n  analysis: 'SimGate 78.2 低于 CogRouter 84.6 约 6 分。叙事不能 claim SOTA，但 controlled ablation\n    提供了强因果证据： SimGate vs internal (+21.4)、vs det (+7.7)、vs random (+14.8)、vs heuristic\n    (+11.4) 全部显著。 catastrophic failure reduction 54% 是强 headline number。 Per-task\n    breakdown 清晰展示 death avoidance 是主要机制——physics/chemistry 的 delta 与 internal death\n    rate 高度相关 (r=0.91)。 3 个弱 tasks (biology/spatial) 的 delta <7 且不显著，支持 A1 的 domain-specific\n    判断。 SimGate 比 CogRouter 差的原因可归为：(1) SFT vs RL training，(2) 无 positive guidance\n    signal。 Paper 叙事应改为 \"first controlled study demonstrating causal role of deterministic\n    computation in preventing catastrophic LLM failures\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-004\n  description: '三条件对比：(a) 1.7B explicit router (SimGate), (b) 1.7B implicit router\n    (SFT output [SIMULATE]), (c) 7B implicit routing (backbone tool-use prompt)。全部用相同\n    counterfactual labels 训练。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    explicit_1_7b_score: 78.2\n    implicit_1_7b_score: 73.5\n    implicit_7b_score: 74.8\n    explicit_minus_implicit_1_7b: 4.7\n    explicit_minus_implicit_7b: 3.4\n    implicit_1_7b_catastrophic_failure_pct: 28.5\n    implicit_7b_catastrophic_failure_pct: 26.2\n    explicit_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 41.2\n    implicit_1_7b_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 35.0\n    implicit_7b_sim_invocation_ratio_pct: 38.5\n    bootstrap_90ci_explicit:\n    - 74.5\n    - 81.8\n    bootstrap_90ci_implicit_1_7b:\n    - 69.2\n    - 77.8\n    bootstrap_90ci_implicit_7b:\n    - 70.5\n    - 79.0\n    explicit_vs_implicit_1_7b_significant: true\n    explicit_vs_implicit_7b_significant: marginal (p=0.08)\n    gpu_hours_actual: 11.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档 explicit_minus_implicit 3-8 分，statistical significance\n    在部分条件下边缘 (A3)。 Explicit 1.7B vs implicit 1.7B: +4.7 分，parameter-matched comparison\n    显著 (p<0.05)。 这说明 explicit modular router 架构本身有价值——将 routing decision 从 generation\n    中解耦， 避免了 implicit routing 中 generation 任务和 routing 任务的 multi-task interference。\n    Explicit 1.7B vs implicit 7B: +3.4 分，但 CI overlap 大 (p=0.08，边缘显著)。 7B implicit\n    比 1.7B implicit 好 1.3 分——额外容量有 marginal 帮助但不足以弥补架构劣势。 Implicit routers 的 sim_invocation_ratio\n    偏低 (35-38.5% vs explicit 41.2%)—— implicit routing 倾向于 under-invoke simulator（routing\n    signal 在 generation logits 中被稀释）， 导致更多 catastrophic failures 未被拦截。 这个 \"consistent\n    but moderate advantage\" 的结果支持 C2 的定性 claim（interpretability, modularity） 而非强 performance\n    claim。Median 档下 C2 的重心应转向： explicit router 可独立替换、routing decisions 可分析，这些定性价值在\n    3-5 分性能差距之上额外成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Explicit vs Implicit Routing Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - params\n    - overall_score\n    - 90% CI\n    - catastrophic_failure (%)\n    - sim_invocation (%)\n    - p vs explicit\n    rows:\n    - - Explicit Router (SimGate)\n      - 1.7B\n      - 78.2\n      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n      - 22.3\n      - 41.2\n      - —\n    - - Implicit Router (SFT)\n      - 1.7B\n      - 73.5\n      - '[69.2, 77.8]'\n      - 28.5\n      - 35.0\n      - '0.03'\n    - - Implicit Routing (tool-use)\n      - 7B\n      - 74.8\n      - '[70.5, 79.0]'\n      - 26.2\n      - 38.5\n      - '0.08'\n    - - Always-Internal\n      - —\n      - 56.8\n      - '[52.0, 61.5]'\n      - 48.5\n      - 0\n      - <0.001\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot: three conditions'' score distributions across task types. Explicit\n    has higher median and tighter IQR. Annotate p-values for pairwise comparisons.'\n  analysis: 'Parameter-matched comparison (1.7B explicit vs 1.7B implicit, +4.7, p=0.03)\n    是 C2 最干净的证据。 7B implicit 条件 (p=0.08) 可写为 \"marginal significance\"，但方向一致。 Median\n    档叙事：explicit routing 是 \"consistent but moderate advantage\"， 主要价值在 architectural\n    benefits (modularity, interpretability, independent replacement)， 用 4.7 分的定量证据\n    + 定性分析支撑。不能写成 \"large performance gap\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Task Routing Pattern Analysis\n  plan_id: plan-005\n  description: '从 plan-003 输出分析 routing patterns：(a) 哪些 task types 触发 deterministic\n    最多， (b) routing 集中在哪个 episode phase，(c) router-as-diagnostic-probe 识别 LLM failure\n    modes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_routing_decisions_analyzed: 3900\n    phase_early_det_pct: 25.0\n    phase_mid_det_pct: 52.0\n    phase_late_det_pct: 38.0\n    physics_det_invocation_pct: 48.5\n    chemistry_det_invocation_pct: 45.2\n    biology_det_invocation_pct: 28.0\n    spatial_det_invocation_pct: 22.0\n    top_3_routing_triggers: state-change actions (heat/cool/mix), multi-step causal\n      chains (>3 steps), post-failure recovery steps\n    failure_mode_clusters_identified: 4\n    cluster_clarity: moderate — 2 clear clusters, 2 diffuse\n    gpu_hours_actual: 1.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档 routing patterns 部分可解释 (A5)——能看到 phase-dependent 模式但\n    failure taxonomy 不够清晰。 Phase-dependent pattern 清晰：mid-game (steps 8-20) routing\n    最密集 (52%)， 因为这个阶段 agent 执行 state-changing actions (加热、冷却、混合) 最多， LLM 容易在多步物理推理中\n    hallucinate 中间状态。 Early-game (steps 1-7) routing 较低 (25%)——agent 主要在 navigate\n    和 gather objects，death 风险低。 Late-game (steps 21-30) routing 中等 (38%)——部分 tasks\n    在此阶段做 final verification， 但也有很多 episodes 已经结束或 stuck。 4 个 failure mode clusters\n    中： (1) \"thermal state tracking failure\" — 清晰，LLM 丢失温度/相态信息 (2) \"chemical reaction\n    sequencing\" — 清晰，LLM 搞错反应步骤顺序 (3) \"multi-step causal confusion\" — 模糊，涵盖多种因果推理错误，不够\n    specific (4) \"environment state drift\" — 模糊，router triggers 散布在各种步骤中 这是 median\n    档 A5 的典型表现——有 pattern 但 failure taxonomy 不 clean。 Paper figure 只报告 phase-dependent\n    routing trends，不宣称 comprehensive failure taxonomy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Routing Decision Distribution by Episode Phase'\n    columns:\n    - phase\n    - steps\n    - total_decisions\n    - det_routing_pct\n    - avg_death_rate_if_internal\n    rows:\n    - - early\n      - 1-7\n      - 1200\n      - 25.0\n      - 0.12\n    - - mid\n      - 8-20\n      - 1800\n      - 52.0\n      - 0.45\n    - - late\n      - 21-30\n      - 900\n      - 38.0\n      - 0.28\n  - name: 'Table: Failure Mode Clusters (Router-as-Diagnostic-Probe)'\n    columns:\n    - cluster\n    - description\n    - n_steps\n    - pct_of_det_routing\n    - clarity\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - thermal state tracking failure\n      - 420\n      - 27.0\n      - clear\n    - - 2\n      - chemical reaction sequencing error\n      - 310\n      - 20.0\n      - clear\n    - - 3\n      - multi-step causal confusion\n      - 480\n      - 31.0\n      - diffuse\n    - - 4\n      - environment state drift\n      - 340\n      - 22.0\n      - diffuse\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 (Paper): Routing heatmap — x=episode step (1-30), y=task type (sorted\n    by domain). Color intensity = deterministic routing probability. Clear ''hot band''\n    in mid-game steps for physics/chemistry tasks. Annotated with phase boundaries.'\n  - 'Supplementary: t-SNE of router hidden states at deterministic-routing steps,\n    colored by cluster ID. Clusters 1&2 tight, clusters 3&4 overlapping.'\n  analysis: 'Phase-dependent routing trend 是 robust 的 finding，可以放 paper Figure 1。\n    但 failure taxonomy 降级处理——从 \"failure mode taxonomy\" 改为 \"we observe routing concentrates\n    at state-change actions during mid-game phases, suggesting the router learns to\n    detect high-risk physical reasoning steps\"。不宣称 comprehensive failure analysis，只报告\n    observable trends。 Mid-game concentration (52% of det routing) 直接对应 death avoidance\n    mechanism—— 这正是 agent 执行 irreversible physical actions 的阶段。\n\n    '\n- name: 2-Way vs 3-Way Routing Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-006\n  description: '补充 deep-internal modality 数据，比较 {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal,\n    deep-internal, deterministic}。 测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有额外价值。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_way_score: 78.2\n    three_way_score: 79.8\n    delta: 1.6\n    p_value: 0.22\n    significant: false\n    three_way_sim_invocation_pct: 39.5\n    three_way_deep_internal_pct: 18.0\n    three_way_fast_internal_pct: 42.5\n    supplemental_data_collection_hours: 5.5\n    router_retraining_hours: 3.0\n    gpu_hours_actual: 9.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 3-way 与 2-way 差距小且不显著 (+1.6, p=0.22)。 Fast/deep internal\n    区分的理论价值在于：deep-internal 在需要更多 reasoning 但不需要 ground-truth 的步骤上 用 extended thinking\n    提升质量。但实际效果有限，原因： (1) death avoidance 是主要增益来源 (A6)——一旦 deterministic 拦截了 catastrophic\n    failures， 剩余步骤中 fast vs deep internal 的差异很小（LLM 在安全步骤上的表现差异不大）。 (2) 没有 positive\n    guidance signal——deep internal 不能给出更好的 task guidance，只是\"想更久\"， 但在 deterministic\n    已经处理了高风险步骤后，多想对安全步骤帮助有限。 (3) Router 从 2-class 升到 3-class 增加了 classification 难度，在\n    median 档标签噪声下性能提升被抵消。 结论：2-way 足够，simplifies the story。Paper 中可以一句话报告 \"binary\n    routing (simulate-or-not) suffices; adding a third modality yields no significant\n    improvement\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Way vs 3-Way Routing Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - routing_scheme\n    - overall_score\n    - 90% CI\n    - sim_invocation (%)\n    - p vs 2-way\n    rows:\n    - - 2-way {int, det}\n      - 78.2\n      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n      - 41.2\n      - —\n    - - 3-way {fast, deep, det}\n      - 79.8\n      - '[75.8, 83.5]'\n      - 39.5\n      - '0.22'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: 2-way vs 3-way per task type. Most bars nearly identical. 标注\n    ns (not significant).'\n  analysis: '3-way 不显著优于 2-way，simplifies the paper narrative。 可以 claim \"binary routing\n    decision (simulate or not) captures the essential routing signal\"， 支持 safety-net\n    framing——router 的核心工作是检测 high-risk steps，而非 fine-grained compute allocation。 在\n    paper 中作为 ablation 一句话报告即可。这增加了实验密度而不改变结论。\n\n    '\n- name: Boil Task Rerun with v3 Code\n  plan_id: plan-007\n  description: '用 v3 clean code（strict > tie-break, death filter only on internal）重跑\n    boil task 20 episodes， 与 MVP 旧代码结果对比，确保分析一致性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    boil_v3_internal_mean: -46.5\n    boil_v3_det_mean: -10.8\n    boil_v3_oracle_mean: -3.2\n    boil_v3_det_minus_internal: 35.7\n    boil_v3_oracle_minus_det: 7.6\n    boil_v3_bootstrap_90ci_det_minus_internal:\n    - 22.0\n    - 49.5\n    boil_v3_death_rate_internal: 0.55\n    boil_v3_death_rate_det: 0.08\n    boil_mvp_internal_mean: -49.8\n    boil_mvp_det_mean: -19.7\n    delta_from_mvp_internal: 3.3\n    delta_from_mvp_det: 8.9\n    gpu_hours_actual: 2.5\n  result_rationale: 'V3 code 的两个修正（strict > tie-break + death filter only on internal）对\n    boil 的影响： (1) Strict > tie-break：减少了 deterministic 被选为 \"best\" 的 marginal cases，\n    internal mean 略有提升 (-49.8 → -46.5) 因为部分原本 tie-break 判给 det 的 cases 现在留在 internal。\n    (2) Death filter only on internal：det mean 显著提升 (-19.7 → -10.8) 因为 MVP 旧代码对 det\n    也做了 death filter， 过滤掉了一些 det 原本能正确处理但被误判为 \"death\" 的 steps。 整体 det_minus_internal\n    从 MVP 的 ~30 分变为 35.7 分，与 melt/change-state 的 ~40 分更接近， 说明 v3 code 修正消除了旧代码的 systematic\n    bias。 Oracle mean 提升到 -3.2（接近 0），更符合预期——selective routing 应当接近 best-of-both。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Boil Task — v3 vs MVP Code Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - MVP (old code)\n    - v3 (clean code)\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - internal_mean\n      - -49.8\n      - -46.5\n      - '+3.3'\n    - - det_mean\n      - -19.7\n      - -10.8\n      - '+8.9'\n    - - oracle_mean\n      - -29.7\n      - -3.2\n      - '+26.5'\n    - - det_minus_internal\n      - 30.1\n      - 35.7\n      - '+5.6'\n    - - death_rate_internal\n      - ~0.6\n      - 0.55\n      - —\n    - - death_rate_det\n      - ~0.15\n      - 0.08\n      - —\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'V3 code 修正提升了数据质量，特别是 oracle routing 从 -29.7 → -3.2 的大幅改善 说明旧 code 的\n    death filter bug 严重低估了 selective routing 的价值。 修正后 boil 与其他 physics tasks (melt,\n    change-state) 的 pattern 更一致， 全部 det_minus_internal 在 35-40 分范围。Paper 只使用 v3 数据。\n\n    '\n- name: Router Size Ablation\n  plan_id: plan-008\n  description: '比较 Qwen3-1.7B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B vs Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router 的效果。 测试 router\n    capacity 敏感性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_1_7b_score: 78.2\n    qwen2_5_1_5b_score: 76.0\n    qwen2_5_3b_score: 79.0\n    qwen3_1_7b_router_accuracy_pct: 71.2\n    qwen2_5_1_5b_router_accuracy_pct: 67.5\n    qwen2_5_3b_router_accuracy_pct: 73.0\n    delta_1_5b_vs_1_7b: -2.2\n    delta_3b_vs_1_7b: 0.8\n    significant_1_5b_vs_1_7b: false\n    significant_3b_vs_1_7b: false\n    inference_latency_1_5b_ms: 12\n    inference_latency_1_7b_ms: 15\n    inference_latency_3b_ms: 28\n    gpu_hours_actual: 10.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 router 性能受限于 label noise 而非 model capacity (plan-002\n    分析已显示)。 1.5B vs 1.7B: -2.2 分但不显著 (p>0.1)——1.5B 容量略不足以 capture 一些 edge case routing\n    patterns， 但差距在标签噪声范围内。Router accuracy 67.5% vs 71.2%，差距主要在 moderate/weak signal\n    tasks。 3B vs 1.7B: +0.8 分不显著——额外容量无法突破标签噪声上限。Router accuracy 73% vs 71.2%， marginal\n    improvement 被 end-to-end evaluation 的 variance 吞没。 这支持 \"lightweight router suffices\"\n    claim：1.5B-3B 范围内性能差异 <3 分， 瓶颈在训练数据质量而非 router capacity。 Inference latency 差异对\n    overall pipeline 影响 negligible（router inference 远快于 LLM backbone inference）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Router Size Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - router\n    - params\n    - router_accuracy (%)\n    - e2e_score\n    - 90% CI\n    - latency (ms)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - 1.5B\n      - 67.5\n      - 76.0\n      - '[71.8, 80.2]'\n      - 12\n    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n      - 1.7B\n      - 71.2\n      - 78.2\n      - '[74.5, 81.8]'\n      - 15\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - 3.0B\n      - 73.0\n      - 79.0\n      - '[75.2, 82.8]'\n      - 28\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x=router params (log scale), y=e2e score. Near-flat line with error\n    bars overlapping. 标注 ''label noise ceiling'' as horizontal band.'\n  analysis: 'Router size ablation 支持两个 claims：(1) 小 router 足够 (\"lightweight\" in C2)，\n    (2) 瓶颈在标签质量——增加 router capacity 收益递减。 Paper 可报告 \"routers from 1.5B to 3B parameters\n    achieve comparable performance (76-79), suggesting the routing task is learnable\n    at modest scale\"。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH Track — Code Interpreter as Oracle\n  plan_id: plan-009\n  description: '500 道 Level 4-5 MATH 题，2-way routing: internal / code-interpreter。\n    测试 safety-aware routing 是否泛化到代码解释器场景。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simgate_math_accuracy_pct: 62.5\n    always_internal_accuracy_pct: 55.0\n    always_code_accuracy_pct: 58.8\n    oracle_routing_accuracy_pct: 68.0\n    simgate_minus_internal: 7.5\n    simgate_minus_always_code: 3.7\n    code_invocation_ratio_pct: 45.0\n    router_accuracy_math_pct: 63.0\n    catastrophic_error_reduction_pct: 28.0\n    gpu_hours_actual: 18.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 MATH track 显示中等泛化 (A4)。 Safety-aware routing 在 MATH\n    上的增益 (+7.5 vs internal) 远小于 ScienceWorld (+21.4)，原因： (1) MATH 没有 -100 death penalty——错误只是\n    0 分而非 catastrophic failure， safety-net 机制的 value proposition 减弱。 (2) Code interpreter\n    的优势在于 arithmetic/algebraic computation，不在于 \"preventing catastrophic failures\"。\n    LLM 在 MATH 上的错误模式更分散（reasoning errors, not just computation errors）， code interpreter\n    只能修正 computation errors 这一子集。 (3) Router 的 ScienceWorld labels 无法直接迁移，MATH 上需要\n    fresh labels， 但 label quality 更差——hindsight labeling 在 MATH 上不如 ScienceWorld 清晰（没有\n    death/survival 信号）。 Router accuracy 仅 63%（低于 ScienceWorld 71.2%），进一步说明 routing\n    signal 在 MATH 上更弱。 Catastrophic error reduction 仅 28%——定义 catastrophic 为 \"算错导致\n    0 分\"， code interpreter 能防止部分但远非全部。 这个结果仍有 paper 价值：证明 selective routing 原则泛化 (simgate\n    > always-code > always-internal)， 但 safety-aware framing 在无 catastrophic penalty\n    的环境中 weakens。可作为 discussion/future work 素材。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: MATH Track Results (Level 4-5, n=500)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - accuracy (%)\n    - code_invocation (%)\n    - computation_error_rate (%)\n    rows:\n    - - Always-Internal\n      - 55.0\n      - 0\n      - 18.5\n    - - Always-Code\n      - 58.8\n      - 100\n      - 5.2\n    - - SimGate Router\n      - 62.5\n      - 45.0\n      - 10.8\n    - - Oracle Routing\n      - 68.0\n      - 38.0\n      - 3.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: MATH results alongside ScienceWorld results (normalized). Clear visual:\n    ScienceWorld gains much larger. 标注 ''catastrophic penalty effect''.'\n  analysis: 'MATH 结果支持 selective > unconditional 的一般原则但效果弱得多。 如果 paper 长度允许，可以作为一段\n    \"Generalization\" 讨论； 如果 4-page 紧张，放 appendix 或 future work 一句话提及。 关键 takeaway：\"safety-aware\n    routing gains are proportional to the severity of catastrophic failure penalties\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Task Transfer within ScienceWorld\n  plan_id: plan-010\n  description: 'Chemistry-only 训练 → physics 评估，physics-only 训练 → chemistry 评估。 测试\n    routing patterns 跨 domain 迁移性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    chem_train_chem_eval_score: 79.5\n    chem_train_phys_eval_score: 72.8\n    phys_train_phys_eval_score: 80.0\n    phys_train_chem_eval_score: 71.5\n    transfer_degradation_chem_to_phys: 7.2\n    transfer_degradation_phys_to_chem: 8.0\n    full_train_phys_eval_score: 82.5\n    full_train_chem_eval_score: 82.0\n    cross_domain_router_accuracy_pct: 62.5\n    same_domain_router_accuracy_pct: 76.0\n    gpu_hours_actual: 4.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档 routing pattern 迁移中等 (A4/A5)。 Chemistry → physics 迁移降幅\n    7.2 分，physics → chemistry 降幅 8.0 分—— 大约 40-50% 的 routing knowledge 可以跨 domain\n    迁移。 原因：death avoidance 的部分 pattern 是 domain-generic 的 （如 \"state-change actions\n    需要 deterministic verification\"）——这个 high-level 模式在两个 domain 共享。 但 domain-specific\n    failure patterns（如 chemistry 的 reaction sequencing vs physics 的 thermal tracking）\n    不迁移，导致 cross-domain router accuracy 从 76% 降到 62.5%。 这个结果在 paper 中可以作为一段 analysis：\"routing\n    patterns partially transfer across task domains sharing similar physical reasoning\n    requirements, but domain-specific failure modes require domain-specific training\n    data\"。 不需要改变 main claims，但增加了对 router generalization 的理解。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Task Transfer Matrix'\n    columns:\n    - train_domain\n    - eval_domain\n    - score\n    - router_accuracy (%)\n    - vs full-train delta\n    rows:\n    - - chemistry\n      - chemistry\n      - 79.5\n      - 78.0\n      - '-2.5'\n    - - chemistry\n      - physics\n      - 72.8\n      - 62.5\n      - '-9.7'\n    - - physics\n      - physics\n      - 80.0\n      - 77.5\n      - '-2.5'\n    - - physics\n      - chemistry\n      - 71.5\n      - 61.0\n      - '-10.5'\n    - - all\n      - physics\n      - 82.5\n      - 78.5\n      - —\n    - - all\n      - chemistry\n      - 82.0\n      - 79.0\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Transfer matrix heatmap: 2x2 grid showing score degradation. Diagonal (same-domain)\n    brighter, off-diagonal darker but not black — partial transfer.'\n  analysis: ~40-50% routing knowledge 跨 domain 迁移，与 median 档 A4 (counterfactual labels\n    泛化中等) 一致。 如果 4-page 紧张，这个实验可以仅在 results 最后一段用 2 句话概括。 重要 insight：routing 的 domain-generic\n    component 是 \"detect state-change actions under uncertainty\"， 这个 framing 比 task-specific\n    failure taxonomy 更 generalizable。\n","numLines":1181,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1181}}}
