{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0118FufwCS72QpQ6eUR5oQAn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015GgvYUBfL1VUc1YbUKtBM3","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"simgate-modular-routing","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4197,"cache_read_input_tokens":18060,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4197,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JboQYnhtZiTU89u4ELSeGU","session_id":"f8e8fc79-eab1-46af-a030-1a02fcf2d909","uuid":"11777277-5601-44b8-9379-9061a0dabbfd"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015GgvYUBfL1VUc1YbUKtBM3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_12/projects/simgate-modular-routing/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## Phase 1 MVP 最终结论 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### Verdict: PASS (4/5 tasks 显著正向)\\\\n\\\\nPhase 1 验证了 fork-based deterministic evaluation 在 ScienceWorld 上显著优于纯 LLM 内部推理。\\\\n\\\\n### 关键设计决策与教训\\\\n\\\\n1. **Tie-break 策略**: `>` (strict) 而非 `>=`。95%+ 步骤 score_delta=0（稀疏奖励），`>=` 会让 oracle 退化为 always-internal。用 `>` 后 oracle 在 tie 时选 deterministic，实验验证这是合理的。\\\\n\\\\n2. **Death filter 只用于有 fork 的模式**: always-internal 是纯 LLM baseline，不能调 fork/is_lethal（方法论问题——Reviewer 会质疑\\\\\\\"你在 internal 模式偷偷用了外部计算\\\\\\\"）。death filter 只在 always-deterministic 和 oracle 中生效。\\\\n\\\\n3. **melt 与 change-state internal 分数巧合相同的解释**: 两个 task 共享 ScienceWorld environment variations（同房间/物品/布局），LLM 表现极差只产生 3 种结果（-100/0/3），分布碰巧一致。不是数据重复。det 分数已验证不同（6/20 episode 有差异）。\\\\n\\\\n4. **boil 数据来自旧代码**（>= tie-break, 无 death filter），full phase 需要用新代码重跑以保证一致性。\\\\n\\\\n5. **grow-plant 无效果**: 三种模式完全一致（0.5±1.4），可能 task 本身过于简单或 30 步不够。\\\\n\\\\n6. **Fork 机制本身没问题**: 诊断确认 fork_and_lookahead 正确工作，score_before 与 main env 一致。收益主要来自避免 -100 致死动作（\\\\\\\"focus on 错误对象\\\\\\\"），而非精细的 score 区分。\\\\n\\\\n7. **vLLM 兼容性**: torch 2.10.0 + vLLM 0.18.1 有 duplicate template name assertion error，需注释 select_algorithm.py 1695/2164 行。\\\\n\\\\n8. **Oracle 增量价值**: 在新代码的 3 个 task 上 oracle > det（Δ +10~17），证明 routing 有独立价值，不是简单的 \\\\\\\"deterministic always wins\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n### 竞品对标\\\\n- CogRouter (arXiv 2602.12662): 同 Qwen2.5-7B, ScienceWorld Score=84.6, SR=72.0%。路由 thinking depth（4 levels），与我们路由 reasoning vs computation 是不同维度。\\\\n- ITP-R (arXiv 2601.08955): Learned world model + K-head gating, SR=63.91%。WM 有 compounding error，我们用 deterministic simulator 避免此问题。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1482, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JboQYnhtZiTU89u4ELSeGU","session_id":"f8e8fc79-eab1-46af-a030-1a02fcf2d909","uuid":"58af369d-3a36-4d63-baaa-87906d227d48","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:12:03.344Z"}
